- userspace/audio/ucm2/: BSD-3-Clause, derived from alsa-ucm-conf
  (https://github.com/alsa-project/alsa-ucm-conf); its licence and copyright
  notice: LICENSES/BSD-3-Clause-alsa-ucm-conf.txt
- dts/*.dtb: compiled from Linux device tree sources, under the licences in
